{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3bb157a7b03a0d10","name":"Light Concussion Missile Launcher","source":{"id":"source:reference-3bb157a7b03a0d10","title":"Light Concussion Missile Launcher","revision":18953,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:02:00Z","sha256":"4180b857a34825d525b84df3a28075acd7b9a83906381aebde6c1e0156ad831a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18953","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Light%20Concussion%20Missile%20Launcher&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3bb157a7b03a0d10","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Light Concussion Missile Launcher is an antivehicle weapon used by military units on battlefields where ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"}," and heavy artillery are often present. A Light Concussion Missile Launcher fires a single missile at a target on each attack, and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rapid Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rapid_Shot","referenceId":"reference:d5cac053fa8ba463"}," feat cannot be used in conjunction with a Light Concussion Missile Launcher. The missile has a 2-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Splash"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Splash"},", and attacks with a Light Concussion Missile Launcher on targets smaller than Huge take a -10 penalty on their attack rolls.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Light Concussion Missile Launcher is an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," weapon. It deals full damage to the target if the attack hits its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," (half damage if it has the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Evasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Evasion"}]}," Talent) and half damage if it misses (no damage if it has the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Evasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Evasion"}," "]},"Talent). Any creature or object in the 2-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Splash"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Splash"}," radius of the target takes half damage if the attack hits (No damage if it has the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Evasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Evasion"}]}," Talent) and no damage if it misses.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Light Concussion Missile Launcher can only hold a single Light Concussion Missile at any given time. Each Light Concussion Missile costs 800 credits, and weighs 10 kilograms.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:a2b1d4c4bac82300"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Large\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 4,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 4d10x2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 18 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Slashing\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," This is an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," weapon.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
